<ansi fg="black-bold">.:</ansi> <ansi fg="magenta">Help for </ansi><ansi fg="command">vitality</ansi>

The <ansi fg="command">vitality</ansi> stat measures your physical hardiness
and endurance.

<ansi fg="yellow">Effects: </ansi>

Vitality is the primary stat behind your maximum Health
pool. Hardier characters can withstand more punishment
before falling. It also influences how quickly you
recover from injuries over time.

Vitality improves through use -- the more you endure
hardship and push through physical challenges, the more
it grows.

